  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "-Multi client local testing is broken again (later clients go home or to new instance)\n-You cannot log out when starting VRChat as the button doesn't work. You need to load into your home world first and then click log out from the settings\n-Having two clients open, logging out and into another account causes both clients to have the same friends list, avatars, and worlds in the menus.\n-You can no longer join the same instance with multiple clients on the same account\n-if one local test client sits in a chair, all the other local test clients get sucked to it and glitch out like they're constantly teleporting to it and unable to sit",
